/-!
# Fixed VERTEX-COVER to HAM-CYCLE reduction machinery

Exports the verified fixed-machine stages used to compute the total raw
reduction.  The nondegenerate target header, all fourteen internal gadget
edges per source-edge occurrence, and the complete selector clique are now
generated by fixed polynomial-time TM2s.  The shared incidence stage now also
has a fixed polynomial-time scanner from the raw VERTEX-COVER encoding to the
canonical per-vertex occurrence rows and formats those rows into every
successive incidence-chain edge.  The remaining selector-endpoint formatter,
followed by guarded total composition, is assembled incrementally from
similarly small modules.
-/
